<title>CHINA: China wheat imports down by 82.9 pct in Jan-June.</title>
<headline>China wheat imports down by 82.9 pct in Jan-June.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 840,000 tonnes of wheat in the first half of the year, down by 82.9 percent compared with the same period of 1996, said customs figures available on Friday.</p>
<p>	 IMPORTS JAN-JUNE	JUNE	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Wheat   840,000		30,000	-82.9</p>
<p>Note: Figures are in tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (86) 10-6532 1921; Fax 10-6532-4978</p>
</text>
